  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 4 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 0800-1800 on Mondays to Fridays and 0800-1300 on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays or public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification), no windows or dormer windows other than those expressly authorised by this permission shall be constructed on the north west or south east elevations. The windows in those elevations which are hereby permitted shall be obscure-glazed and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscure glazing.",
    "Condition : 6 - All planting, seeding or turfing comprised in the details of landscaping hereby approved and shown on drawing No. 4/1/2 shall be carried out in the first planting and seeding seasons following the occupation of the building or the completion of the development, whichever is the sooner; and any trees or plants which within a period of 5 years from the completion of the development die, are removed or become seriously damaged or diseased shall be replaced in the next planting season with others of similar size and species, unless otherwise agreed in writing with the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The dwelling hereby permitted shall not be occupied until the means of vehicular access has been constructed and space has been laid out within the site in accordance with drawing No. 1/4/2 for 4 cars to be parked and those parking spaces shall thereafter be retained for that purpose."
  ],
